# "Target creature with power less than or equal to this creature's power" is checked again as the ability resolves (CR
# 608.2b). Bot1's Old Man of the Sea targets Bot2's Llanowar Elves; in response Bot2 casts Swift Reconfiguration on the Elves,
# a Vehicle artifact and no creature now (CR 205.1a). It has no power (CR 208.3), but it is no creature at all, so it is no
# longer a legal target and the ability does nothing: the Elves stays Bot2's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Island
Old Man of the Sea
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Pearl
Swift Reconfiguration
Forest x16

